# Sender domains, matched against the From header's domain by the
# local_sender_domain rule in multimap.conf. Regular expressions, one
# per line.
#
# .shop accounts for 119 of the 139 messages filed into TrainSpam in
# the month to 2026-09-04, one throwaway subdomain per message
# (home.ceramichesicilianeruggeri.shop, zen.catreport.shop, ...), and
# for 1 of the 11932 messages in every folder this account keeps - a
# message from that same campaign, sitting in the INBOX unread.
#
# This is a statement about this mailbox, not about the TLD: nobody
# here corresponds with a shop. Delete the line the day somebody does.
/\.shop$/i
